; CALIBRATE DIP EACH: dip into each jar once, touch the bottom, draw a tiny circle
; offsets from data/calibration.json: X -14.5  Y +7.1  Z +1.1
; brush stick-out below the cartridge: 10.1 mm
; BEFORE STARTING: cartridge OFF (G28 raises the bed to nozzle height). Jars in, no paint needed.
; WARNING J5: can only reach 39.0 mm above the jar floor, not the bottom (cartridge would hit the rim)
; WARNING J4: can only reach 39.0 mm above the jar floor, not the bottom (cartridge would hit the rim)
; WARNING J3: can only reach 39.0 mm above the jar floor, not the bottom (cartridge would hit the rim)
; WARNING J2: can only reach 39.0 mm above the jar floor, not the bottom (cartridge would hit the rim)
; WARNING J1: can only reach 39.0 mm above the jar floor, not the bottom (cartridge would hit the rim)
