M140 S0
M107
G21
G90
G28 ; home X, Y, Z with the cartridge off
G1 Z58.23 F600 ; bed down: brush tip 57.1 mm above the glass, clear of the rims
M400
M117 Attach brush, then Resume
@pause ; snap the cartridge on, then press Resume
